      "year": 2024,
      "medium": "Oil on canvas",
      "description": "Painting 1 from The Greece Residency, January 2024. This painting explores the concept of time, how our journey began at a specific point, bringing with it everything we've been, into the present, shaping a future that remains undefined. Each of us carries a layer of mystery, unknown even to ourselves, drawing the universe toward us as it seeks harmony with us. The residency centered on the significance of myth and the role of mystery in both the physical and psychological realms. Vikram discovered a world where the continuity of myth relies on human belief and faith and the influence and power we hold over time that has passed.",
