      "title": "\u0a1a\u0a3f\u0a70\u0a24\u0a3e / \u0a1a\u0a3f\u0a70\u0a24\u0a28",
      "year": 2023,
      "medium": "Oil on canvas",
      "description": "Have you ever felt blind in a garden, forgotten how to smell and hear the grandness of co-existing abundance? What did you choose over all that so you could feel a sense of belonging? Did you give structure only to that dark thought? Some interactions with my closest people made me question if too much optimism leads to a kind of separation, triggering a chain reaction of doubts. But the truth is, nothing will slow time down. We might as well dive into the chaos, and we'll feel that the abundance will bring belonging to us.",
